# PhoneZone - repository hygiene.
#
# HARD RULE: real customer data must never be committed or zipped.
# `data/`, `data11/` and every *.db / *.db-wal / *.db-shm / *.tar.gz hold
# Aadhaar photos, customer names, phone numbers and the live business database.

# ---- real business data (NEVER share, NEVER commit) ----
data/
data11/
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.tar.gz
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# ---- agent backups / generated deliverables ----
_backup_*/
deliverables/
*.zip
ADHAR/
mobile one/
.agents/
# VERIFY_OUTPUT.txt is deliberately NOT ignored: it is the evidence file the
# owner must be able to find and send for review.

# ---- logs and debug scratch ----
logs/
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*
err.txt
out.txt
vite-out.log
ngrok-*
tmp-*.mjs
.tmp-*.mjs
tmp-*.png
back-*.png
scratch/

# ---- builds / dependencies ----
node_modules
dist
dist-ssr
dist-electron
release
*.local

# ---- OS / editor directories and files ----
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea
.DS_Store
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?

# ---- OCR language data (the copy under public/ocr is what the app uses) ----
/*.traineddata
